        "# GPU Setup & Cloud Notebook\n\n> Hands-on Build It and Exercises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Build It"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Option 1: Local NVIDIA GPU"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Check if you have one:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "nvidia-smi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Install PyTorch with CUDA:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "import torch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "print(f\"CUDA available: {torch.cuda.is_available()}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "print(f\"CUDA version: {torch.version.cuda}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "if torch.cuda.is_available():"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(f\"GPU: {torch.cuda.get_device_name(0)}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    print(f\"Memory: {torch.cuda.get_device_properties(0).total_memory / 1e9:.1f} GB\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Option 2: Google Colab"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "1. Go to [colab.research.google.com](https://colab.research.google.com)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "2. Runtime > Change runtime type > T4 GPU"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "3. Run `!nvidia-smi` to verify"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Upload notebooks from this course directly to Colab."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Option 3: Cloud GPU"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "For Lambda Labs, RunPod, or Vast.ai:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```bash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "ssh user@your-gpu-instance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "pip install torch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "python -c \"import torch; print(torch.cuda.get_device_name(0))\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### No GPU? No problem."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Most lessons work on CPU. The ones that need GPU will say so and include Colab links."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```python"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "device = torch.device(\"cuda\" if torch.cuda.is_available() else \"cpu\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "print(f\"Using: {device}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
